claim.claim-text:
a shell (1), and a depilation mechanism (22) and a heat dissipation mechanism (21) inside the shell (1), and at least two outlets,
wherein the shell (1) is provided with one inlet (11); the heat dissipation mechanism (21) comprises a heat conductive component (212);
and the one inlet (11) is separately in communication with different outlets of the at least two outlets, to form at least two channels; each of the at least two channels is provided with an element generating heat; and after being introduced from the one inlet (11), under a guidance of the heat conductive component (212), an external cooling medium separately passes through different channels of the at least two channels and the external cooling medium is then discharged from a corresponding outlet of the at least two outlets, and the external cooling medium brings the heat of a separately passing region out of the shell (1);
wherein the heat conductive component (212) is provided with a first vent (2121) and a second vent (2122); the external cooling medium is air, a fan (211) is provided inside the shell (1), the fan (211) is provided with a fan air inlet (2111) and a fan air outlet (2112),
wherein the one inlet (11), the fan air inlet (2111), the fan air outlet (2112), the first vent (2121), and one of the at least two outlets are sequentially in communication with each other to form a first channel of the at least two channels;
the one inlet (11), the fan air inlet (2111), the fan air outlet (2112), the second vent (2122) and one of the at least two outlets are sequentially in communication with each other to form a second channel of the at least two channels.
